1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,070
Okay let's look at one more topic.
好，我们再来看一个话题。

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,120
You seem a bit down everything okay.
你看起来有点低落，还好吗？

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:16,000
Uh I have too much work you always say that yes but I'm really under a lot of pressure.
嗯，我工作太多了。你总这么说。是的，但我现在确实压力很大。

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,550
Right now I feel stressed all the time and I have no time for myself.
我一直觉得很有压力，完全没有自己的时间。

5
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:27,079
That doesn't sound healthy you can't just work all day every day you'll burn out eventually.
这听起来不太健康。不能每天从早工作到晚，不然最终会耗尽精力。

6
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:35,510
I know but what can I do every week there are deadlines calls meetings problems it never stops.
我知道，可我能怎么办？每周总有截止日期、电话、会议、问题，永远没完。

7
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:39,510
I don't know but I think work life balance is really important.
我也不知道，但我觉得工作与生活的平衡真的很重要。

8
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:45,520
Since I moved companies two years ago I make a lot less money but I'm much happier.
自从两年前换公司以来，我挣的钱少多了，但快乐多了。

9
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:51,350
I don't regret it you only get one life you can't spend it all in the office.
我不后悔。人生只有一次，不能全都在办公室里度过。

10
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:58,390
You think I need to change jobs I don't know but I think you need to have time and energy for your personal life.
你觉得我需要换工作吗？我不知道，但我觉得你需要为个人生活留有时间和精力。

11
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:01,620
Otherwise it's difficult to feel good about life.
否则，很难对生活感到满意。

12
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:08,310
Let's start with an important point which english learners often make mistakes with.
先说一个英语学习者经常弄错的重要点。

13
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:12,950
Look at one of the first phrases from the dialogue.
看对话开头的一个短语。

14
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:19,990
Now look at another sentence what's the difference.
再看另一个句子。区别在哪里？

15
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,320
A lot is just a fact if you have a lot of work you have a large quantity of work.
a lot 只陈述事实：如果你有 a lot of work，就表示工作量很大。

16
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:33,200
Pretty simple too much is different because it also expresses an opinion.
很简单。too much 则不同，因为它还表达了一种看法。

17
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:39,760
If you have too much work then you have a lot of work and you aren't happy about it.
如果说工作 too much，就意味着工作很多，而且你对此不满意。

18
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:45,670
Maybe it's making you stressed or you don't have time for anything else.
可能它使你感到压力，或使你没有时间做别的事。

19
00:01:45,680 --> 00:02:02,080
This is true generally whenever you use the word to you're expressing a negative opinion about something remember this although it might seem like a small difference it's important.
一般来说都是如此：当你使用 too 这个词时，就是在对某事表达负面评价。记住这一点。虽然区别看起来很小，但很重要。

20
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:09,990
So let's think about some questions think about how you could answer these.
现在想想这些问题，思考自己可以怎样回答。

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,760
Pause the video if you need some time to think of course.
如果需要时间思考，可以暂停视频。当然——

22
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:21,430
There are many possible answers but let's see one example for each.
可能的答案有很多，但我们为每个问题看一个示范回答。

23
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:25,680
Do you have a good work life balance yes pretty good.
你的工作与生活平衡好吗？嗯，挺好的。

24
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:30,120
In general I work hard but I make sure to stop at six o'clock at the latest.
总体而言，我努力工作，但一定最晚六点停下来。

25
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:35,589
And I don't take work home with me or work on the weekends.
我不把工作带回家，也不在周末工作。

26
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:39,110
If you work too hard you'll feel stressed and miserable.
如果工作太拼，会觉得有压力、很难受。

27
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:45,589
And you won't have time or energy for other important parts of your life.
而且没有时间和精力顾及生活中其他重要的部分。

28
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:53,110
I think it's good to have a fixed routine so you start and finish and take breaks at the same time every day.
我觉得固定作息很好，这样每天都在相同的时间开始、结束工作，并按时休息。

29
00:02:53,120 --> 00:03:00,870
Also it's important to say no to other people sometimes so that you don't have too much to do.
另外，有时向别人说不也很重要，这样就不会有太多事情要做。

30
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:04,230
What about you were your answers similar.
你呢？你的回答和示例相似吗？
